<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Cape Girardeau, Mo., school GOs.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Cape Girardeau, Mo., school GOs.</headline>
<text>
<p>CAPE GIRARDEAU, MISSOURI PUBLIC SCHOOLS</p>
<p>RE: $14,000,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION SCHOOL BUILDING BONDS</p>
<p>(MISSOURI DIRECT DEPOSIT PROGRAM) SERIES 1997</p>
